## 9. Notification Preferences (Kullanıcı Ayarları)

```tsx
<SettingsPage>
  <Section title="Bildirim Tercihleri">
    {channels.map((ch) => (
      <PreferenceRow key={ch.key}>
        <div>
          <div className="font-medium">{ch.label}</div>
          <div className="text-xs text-muted">{ch.description}</div>
        </div>
        <div className="flex gap-2">
          <Switch label="Push" checked={prefs[ch.key].push} onChange={...} />
          <Switch label="E-posta" checked={prefs[ch.key].email} onChange={...} />
        </div>
      </PreferenceRow>
    ))}
  </Section>
</SettingsPage>
```

Default tercihler `notification-matrix.md`'den gelir.

